  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A metal ball of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is released from rest and falls through a distance of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span>, reaching speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. The specific heat capacity of the metal is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"c\"></span>. What is the change in the temperature of the ball?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgh-mv^{2}}{c}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2mgh-mv^{2}}{2c}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{gh-v^{2}}{c}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2gh-v^{2}}{2c}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
